      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (gpt-6-astra), reconciling independent Tibetan-first and English-first proposals. The opponent considers three beings and one shared glass of something wet and flowing; supplied different types and sit down remain unwrapped. The person born there is the experiencer of the appearance, not a maker. Gyis and yis mark active subjects with no separately alignable English exponent. The actual-existence denial is split only at defensible actual/absence words; grub pa and the remaining copular recast are omitted. Thal is a consequence predicate in these constructions, not a standalone modal particle; its interrogative framing is distributed and omitted. Su yang med pa supplies no one at all, while the maker relative clause is unbanked. Ci las supplies a source question jointly; Where is not banked as an isolated ci equivalent and the distributed question frame is omitted. Repeated burning-steel compounds and gsungs occurrences retain their distinct source locations. La sogs pa licenses the complete closing gesture and so on. The sdig sems compound and its two members are supported provisionally by this complete verse; the master compound remains awaiting an HGM equivalent. Thub pas retains its inseparable agentive ending and GMR's plural. The exclusive emphasis beyond Is is omitted. All source text remains verbatim."
